#| fig-cap: "Observed versus fitted CC/CE for selected benchmark models. The composition benchmark (Model A) and the nested model (Model F) are compared against the unemployment-rate-only benchmark (Model B) and the expanded aggregate benchmark (Model C). All models include month-of-year fixed effects."
#| fig-height: 8

